# Evidence Examiner: both abilities are "you": the beginning-of-combat trigger is "on your turn" and the Clue is for "you collect evidence" (CR 701.59a, 603.2). Turn 1 Bot1 casts the Examiner and, after
# combat, Entomb for Wrath of God, so its graveyard holds 5 mana value of evidence. On turn 2 Bot2 collects evidence 8 for Analyze the Pollen (exiling two Heroes of Bladehold from its own graveyard);
# Bot1 gets no Clue, and when Bot2's combat begins Bot1 is not asked to collect evidence - its graveyard is untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Evidence Examiner
Entomb
Island
Island
Wrath of God
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Faithless Looting
Analyze the Pollen
Hero of Bladehold
Hero of Bladehold
Swamp
Island
Island
Island
Llanowar Elves
Forest
Island x8

